abstract: >-
  The Universal Protection Theory at released status (GLOBAL D:
  CLOSED-AT-DECLARED-PREMISES): ratified canon invariant, funded-repair
  thermodynamic core, identity-by-continuation layer, E9 adversarial
  containment trichotomy, H5 meet algebra, and universal greatestness over
  the class of physically implementable rivals, on a seven-point declared
  premise stack. Includes verified manuscript renders, zero-warning Lean
  modules (core and Mathlib-pinned analytic bridge), an exact-rational
  hash-chained replayable ledger, reproducibility containers, and an
  RO-Crate FAIR manifest.
